{"fileVersion":"1.0","metadata":{"title":"Molecule Node Class","description":"Chemical molecule identity class for bonded atom structures.","created":"2026-08-18T18:03:00.000Z","modified":"2026-08-18T18:03:00.000Z","author":"","tags":["node-class","chemistry","molecule"],"preferredViewer":"https://twilite.zone"},"nodes":[{"id":"molecule-declaration","type":"declaration","label":"Molecule Node Class Declaration","root":false,"position":{"x":0,"y":-520},"width":520,"height":390,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"molecule-class","name":"Molecule Node Class","version":"0.1.0","description":"A molecule is a persistent chemical identity for a bonded structure of atom instances."},"intent":{"kind":"node-class","scope":"shared"},"declaration":{"kind":"node-class","targetMode":"artifact","defaultSurfaceId":"root","surfaces":[{"id":"root","kind":"port","label":"Detail","portNodeId":"molecule-detail-view","viewNodeId":"molecule-detail-view"},{"id":"detail","kind":"port","label":"Detail","portNodeId":"molecule-detail-view","viewNodeId":"molecule-detail-view"},{"id":"summary","kind":"port","label":"Summary","portNodeId":"molecule-summary-view","viewNodeId":"molecule-summary-view"},{"id":"icon","kind":"port","label":"Icon","portNodeId":"molecule-icon-view","viewNodeId":"molecule-icon-view"},{"id":"editor","kind":"port","label":"Editor","portNodeId":"molecule-editor-view","viewNodeId":"molecule-editor-view"}]},"nodeClass":{"contractVersion":"1.0.0","key":"molecule","label":"Molecule","meaning":"A persistent chemical entity defined by a bonded structure of atom instances.","description":"The molecule node provides identity and presentation for a molecular structure. Constituent atoms and bond semantics belong in graph relationships rather than duplicated arrays on the molecule node. Formula, atom count, bond count, molecular mass, and net charge are derived when the graph contains sufficient structure.","requiredDataKeys":["name"],"nodeDef":{"key":"molecule","ref":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/ideas/graph-native-chemistry/molecule.node-class.node","source":"local","version":">=0.1.0","defaults":{"label":"Molecule","size":{"width":460,"height":320},"color":"#0369a1","showLabel":false,"data":{"name":"","state":""},"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}]}}},"dependencies":{"nodeTypes":["declaration","markdown","port"],"portContracts":["core"],"schemaVersions":{"nodes":">=1.0.0","ports":">=1.0.0"},"optional":[]},"authority":{"mutation":{"allowCreate":true,"allowUpdate":true,"allowDelete":true,"appendOnly":false},"actors":{"humans":true,"agents":true,"tools":true},"styleAuthority":"descriptive","history":{"rewriteAllowed":false,"squashAllowed":false}}}},{"id":"molecule-contract","type":"markdown","label":"Molecule Contract","root":false,"position":{"x":-650,"y":-30},"width":520,"height":390,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"molecule-class"},"markdown":"# Molecule\n\nA molecule is modeled as a **persistent identity for a bonded structure of atom instances**.\n\n## Authored fields\n\n- `name` — required human-readable identity\n- `state` — optional descriptive physical/electronic state\n\nThe graph carries the molecular structure. Constituent Atom nodes and Single/Double/Triple Bond edges are the structural truth.\n\nWhen sufficient structure exists, `formula`, atom count, bond count, molecular mass, and net charge should be derived rather than duplicated on the Molecule node.\n\nIonization does not require a separate molecule class: net charge follows from proton and electron counts across the structure."}},{"id":"molecule-editor-view","type":"port","label":"Editor","root":false,"position":{"x":-40,"y":20},"width":440,"height":330,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"molecule-class","portId":"editor","name":"Molecule Editor"},"view":{"intent":"editor","payload":"editor.web"},"editor":{"web":{"fields":[{"key":"name","label":"Name","type":"text","path":"data.name"},{"key":"state","label":"State","type":"text","path":"data.state"}]}},"semanticLevel":"editor","visibilityRole":"editor"}},{"id":"molecule-icon-view","type":"port","label":"Icon","root":false,"position":{"x":480,"y":20},"width":300,"height":240,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"molecule-class","portId":"icon","name":"Molecule Icon"},"view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.icon","semanticLevel":"icon"},"semanticLevel":"icon","renderShape":{"kind":"html"},"html":"<div style='width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:24px;background:#082f49;border:3px solid #38bdf8;color:#f0f9ff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;overflow:hidden;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'><span style='width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:#e0f2fe;border:3px solid #7dd3fc;display:block;'></span><span style='width:52px;height:4px;background:#7dd3fc;display:block;'></span><span style='width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:50%;background:#0ea5e9;border:3px solid #bae6fd;display:block;'></span></div><div style='margin-top:18px;font:850 15px system-ui,sans-serif;'>{{data.name}}</div></div>","visibilityRole":"browser"}},{"id":"molecule-summary-view","type":"port","label":"Summary","root":false,"position":{"x":860,"y":20},"width":480,"height":270,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"molecule-class","portId":"summary","name":"Molecule Summary"},"view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.summary","semanticLevel":"summary"},"semanticLevel":"summary","renderShape":{"kind":"html"},"html":"<div style='width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:24px;background:#082f49;border:3px solid #0284c7;color:#f0f9ff;padding:26px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;overflow:hidden;'><div style='font:900 28px system-ui,sans-serif;'>{{data.name}}</div><div style='margin-top:18px;font:750 14px system-ui,sans-serif;color:#bae6fd;'>Molecule</div><div style='margin-top:10px;font:700 14px system-ui,sans-serif;color:#e0f2fe;'>Structure is carried by Atom nodes and bond edges.</div><div style='margin-top:12px;font:700 13px system-ui,sans-serif;color:#7dd3fc;'>{{data.state}}</div></div>","visibilityRole":"browser"}},{"id":"molecule-detail-view","type":"port","label":"Detail","root":true,"position":{"x":320,"y":500},"width":620,"height":360,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"molecule-class","portId":"detail","name":"Molecule Detail"},"view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.detail","semanticLevel":"detail"},"semanticLevel":"detail","renderShape":{"kind":"html"},"html":"<div style='width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:26px;background:#0c4a6e;border:3px solid #38bdf8;color:#f8fafc;padding:30px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;overflow:hidden;'><div style='font:950 32px system-ui,sans-serif;'>{{data.name}}</div><div style='margin-top:12px;font:800 14px system-ui,sans-serif;color:#bae6fd;'>MOLECULE</div><div style='margin-top:24px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#e0f2fe;'>Its constituent atoms and bond orders are represented by the surrounding graph rather than duplicated inside this node.</div><div style='margin-top:18px;color:#7dd3fc;font-weight:750;'>{{data.state}}</div></div>","visibilityRole":"browser"}}],"edges":[{"id":"molecule-declaration-contract","source":"molecule-declaration","target":"molecule-contract","sourceHandle":"left","targetHandle":"right","type":"reference","label":"contract"},{"id":"molecule-declaration-editor","source":"molecule-declaration","target":"molecule-editor-view","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"editor"},{"id":"molecule-declaration-icon","source":"molecule-declaration","target":"molecule-icon-view","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"icon"},{"id":"molecule-declaration-summary","source":"molecule-declaration","target":"molecule-summary-view","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"summary"},{"id":"molecule-declaration-detail","source":"molecule-declaration","target":"molecule-detail-view","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"detail"}],"clusters":[],"settings":{"theme":null,"backgroundImage":null,"defaultNodeColor":"#1976d2","defaultEdgeColor":"#666666","snapToGrid":false,"gridSize":20,"edgeRouting":"auto","autoSave":false},"scripts":[]}